  "notes": {
    "s1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 844,
      "text": "Fame Fleet · Office mode\n\nSame app as Fame Driver, a second interface for office sign-ins. Same tokens as the driver screens: ink #15181c, surface #22272c, page #f3f2ee, amber #f2a900 (primary + active tab), blue #1e4fa0 (live / in progress), amber text #8a5a00 (warnings), red #b3261e (danger). IBM Plex Sans body, IBM Plex Mono for plates, times and numbers, Archivo ExtraBold headings. Sinhala: Yaldevi body, Gemunu Libre headings. Digits always Latin.\n\nTabs by role\nRequester: Home · My trips · Notifications · Me\nDispatcher: Home · Tasks · Live · Drivers · More\nFleet admin: Home · Approve · Live · Drivers · More\n\nPatterns\nOne job per screen, steps with a sticky primary button. Map-first trip screens with a bottom sheet. Cards and chips, never tables. 48 px tap targets. Back always goes back; forward links are labelled. Plates in mono inside a thin chip.\n\nPlay mode: tap the amber buttons and tabs to move between screens.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 148
    },
    "s2": {
      "fill": "blue",
      "maxH": 600,
      "text": "Management screens follow PERMISSIONS, not job titles. Whoever holds a permission sees its section: the fleet admin (Palitha) does this work daily; the boss has the same access.\n\nvehicles: add, edit, switch off, photos and documents by camera.\nusers: drivers (add, reset PIN, switch off) and office users (permissions, set-password link).\nQuick settings and reports: the same permission as on the site.\n\nLaptop only: site import, projects, map package and Google caps, fuel-video checklist and other detailed settings, audit log.",
      "w": 380,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 4400
    },
